config RTC_SUNXI
	bool "Allwinner sunxi RTC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ALLWINNER_SUNXI_RTC_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the real time clock of the Allwinner sunxi SoCs: the date and the time of day
	  from 1970 to 2097, and one alarm that fires at a date and time.
